# Tuning artefacts.
#
# Keep these out of version control on purpose: results.json and report.html
# contain the decoded contents of your barcodes and the absolute paths of the
# images you tuned on. On a customer dataset that is their product, batch and
# serial numbers. Share a run by attaching the file deliberately, never by
# committing it.
out/
autotune_out/
*_out/
cross-validation.json

